hận khách có hẹn</b></li><li><b>Có lối đi cho xe lăn</b></li><li><b>Nhận thẻ tín dụng</b></li><li><b>Wi-Fi miễn phí</b></li><li><b>Chỗ đậu xe</b><span>Có cả chỗ để xe đạp</span></li><li><b>Thân thiện với trẻ em</b></li><li><b>Giá cho người cao tuổi &amp; quân nhân</b><span>Một số thợ có giá riêng cho người 65+ và quân nhân/lực lượng ứng cứu</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Hình ảnh</p><h2>Bên trong Marty&#39;s</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Các ghế cắt bên trong Marty&#39;s\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"Low taper fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/hot-towel-shave.jpg\" alt=\"Cạo khăn nóng\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade.jpg\" alt=\"Kiểu fade mới cắt\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard.jpg\" alt=\"Tỉa râu và tạo viền\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"Rẽ ngôi lệch kèm fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/kids-fade.jpg\" alt=\"Fade cho bé\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/team.jpg\" alt=\"Các thợ ở lối vào tiệm\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Đánh giá</p><h2>Khách hàng nói gì</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 176 đánh giá</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Xem thêm đánh giá trên Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 1332 đánh giá</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Xem thêm đánh giá trên Booksy →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Marty’s Barbershop delivers excellent service in a professional and welcoming environment. Marty is highly skilled, consistent and provides great hospitality. My Barber, Foofades is also outstanding, with great attention to detail and overall an amazing guy to talk to.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Best barber out in Vacaville, never disappointed me every time I came in🫡💯”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jaden · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/263621_martythebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I was literally walking out of my doctors appointment thinking about looking for a barber when I crossed paths with the owner. He brought me in and the vibes were amazing. Great people, amazing skills and overall amazing experience. It didn’t feel like going in to just get a cut. I got an experience.You gotta get a fresh cut from these guys.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Viv does an amazing job! She’s thorough, detail-oriented, and listens to her clients. Every haircut I’ve gotten from her is great and grows out well between cuts!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kendra · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/658054_hercuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Thank you, Hudson for making our first experience at this barbershop and with you great! It is evident you take pride in your craft and the results show for itself. We are very satisfied with our son’s haircut by you. I definitely recommend booking with him. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Jared always does a great job. Great attention to Detail and many years of experience. If you’re looking for a new barber,Jared is the guy. He’s been cutting my hair for over 10 years.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Bradley · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“He cut my haircut like how I imagined it. Takes his time and doesn’t rush. Cleanest skin mid fade in the area”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nish · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/966669_joe-big-money-lopez_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Carlos provided a great cut along with efficient timing, I would highly recommend his services!👌🏽”</blockquote><figcaption>— Emani · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593463_losblendzz_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“10/10 recommend this shop! Marty cuts my sons hair an always is quick, smooth and always makes my sons experience exceptional. If your not getting your hair cut here your missing out.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great haircut, Good convo &amp; Good vibes. Eli got me right. Thanks!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alex024 · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1244424_fadezbyeli-martysbarbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Hỏi đáp</p><h2>Giải đáp thắc mắc</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Có cần đặt hẹn không?</summary><p>Bạn có thể đặt lịch trực tuyến với bất kỳ ai trong chúng tôi. Chủ nhật chỉ nhận khách có hẹn, còn các ngày trong tuần và Thứ Bảy thì khách vãng lai cũng được chào đón.</p></details><details><summary>Cắt tóc giá bao nhiêu?</summary><p>Cắt tóc tiêu chuẩn là $40–$50, tùy thợ. Xem trang đặt lịch của thợ để biết giá hiện tại.</p></details><details><summary>Tiệm có giảm giá cho người cao tuổi hoặc quân nhân không?</summary><p>Có. Một số thợ của chúng tôi cắt cho người cao tuổi (65+) giá $30 và cho quân nhân/lực lượng ứng cứu giá $35–$40.</p></details><details><summary>Tiệm có cạo khăn nóng không?</summary><p>Có chứ. Marty cạo truyền thống giá $40, và cắt tóc cùng cạo truyền thống với khăn nóng giá $75. Viviana và Joe cũng cạo truyền thống bằng dao.</p></details><details><summary>Tiệm có nhận thẻ không?</summary><p>Có, chúng tôi nhận thẻ.</p></details><details><summary>Có Wi-Fi và lối đi cho xe lăn không?</summary><p>Có. Chúng tôi có Wi-Fi miễn phí và tiệm có lối đi cho xe lăn.</p></details><details><summary>Giờ mở cửa thế nào?</summary><p>Chúng tôi mở cửa T2–T6 9 giờ sáng–6 giờ chiều và T7 9 giờ sáng–3 giờ chiều. Chủ nhật chỉ nhận khách có hẹn.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Ghé thăm</p>\n      <h2>Giờ mở cửa &amp; địa chỉ</h2>\n      <address>2611 Nut Tree Rd Ste E<br>Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\">(707) 660-8108</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Thứ Hai</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Thứ Ba</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Thứ Tư</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Thứ Năm</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Thứ Sáu</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Thứ Bảy</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Chủ nhật</td><td>Đóng cửa</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Chủ nhật chỉ nhận khách có hẹn.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martysbarbershop_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@martysbarbershop_</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2